              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Waire enaku edho dhiriba dhityo, aye era tiribazikiriza mwenamwena kubamalagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era iwe Yeremia, abantu bwebalibuuza bati, ‘Lwaki Musengwa Katonda waife yatuleetera bino byonabyona okututuukaku?’ Olibairamu oti, ‘Nga bwe mwamuvaaku ni musinza mu nsi yaimwe bakatonda ab'amaghanga agandi, mwidha kutwalibwa mugheereze abagwira mu nsi etali yaimwe.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
